# Security

- `GEMINI_API_KEY` / `X_BEARER_TOKEN` server-only; never expose to client bundles.
- SSRF: https/http only; block private/link-local/metadata IPs; timeout + size cap; careful redirects.
- Cap paste/body sizes; sanitize error messages (no key leakage).
- No auth in MVP — disclose unprotected deploy in README.
